You can easily reverse a string by characters with the following example:

Explanation:We start with an empty stringreversedStr.- On each loop, we take one character from the original string usingcharAt().- Instead of adding it to the end, we place it in front of the existingreversedStr.- This way, the characters are built in reverse order.For example, from"Hello"we get"olleH".

